Z||000001||william_thorniii||01-27-2000||01:18 PM||||Dan,<P>I don't remember if I have seen the site. In theory it would work though.  The GN's had a 3800 Series I.  The block is virtually identical to a 3800 Series II.  Unless I am missing something, it should go in rather easy... especially in your car since it has already been converted to a 3800 setup.  The intake is slightly higher, but could be massaged to work.  It would be just plug and play for you!  If anyone knows otherwise, please let me know!<P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||5
